[{"text":"Nielsen[i, j, x] denotes Nielsen’s polylogarithm.","anchor":"nielsen"},{"text":"Overview, SimplifyPolyLog.","anchor":"see-also","section":"See also"},{"text":"Nielsen[1, 2, x]","anchor":"cb1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[S_{12}(x)\\]","anchor":"cb1-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"Numerical evaluation is done via N[Nielsen[n_,p_,x_]] := (-1)^(n+p-1)/(n-1)!/p! NIntegrate[Log[1-x t]^p Log[t]^(n-1)/t,{t,0,1}]","anchor":"cb1-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"N[Nielsen[1, 2, .45]]","anchor":"cb2","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[0.0728716\\]","anchor":"cb2-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"Some special values are built in.","anchor":"cb2-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"{Nielsen[1, 2, 0], Nielsen[1, 2, -1], Nielsen[1, 2, 1/2], Nielsen[1, 2, 1]}","anchor":"cb3","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\left\\{0,\\frac{\\zeta (3)}{8},\\frac{\\zeta (3)}{8},\\zeta (3)\\right\\}\\]","anchor":"cb3-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"Nielsen[1, 2, x, PolyLog -> True]","anchor":"cb4","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[-\\text{Li}_3(1-x)+\\text{Li}_2(1-x) \\log (1-x)+\\frac{1}{2} \\log (x) \\log ^2(1-x)+\\zeta (3)\\]","anchor":"cb4-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"Nielsen[1, 3, x, PolyLog -> True]","anchor":"cb5","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[-\\text{Li}_4(1-x)-\\frac{1}{2} \\;\\text{Li}_2(1-x) \\log ^2(1-x)+\\text{Li}_3(1-x) \\log (1-x)-\\frac{1}{6} \\log (x) \\log ^3(1-x)+\\frac{\\pi ^4}{90}\\]","anchor":"cb5-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"Nielsen[3, 1, x, PolyLog -> True]","anchor":"cb6","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\text{Li}_4(x)\\]","anchor":"cb6-1","section":"Examples"}]